# SPLAT RULES. These four must stay last.
#
# Cloudflare splits a _redirects file into two lists with separate caps: 2,000
# static rules and 100 dynamic rules. The split is positional, not per rule.
# Every rule from the first splat or placeholder onward is counted as dynamic,
# so that first-match ordering is preserved. On 2026-09-01 the splat at what
# was line 73 turned all 138 rules below it into dynamic rules and the deploy
# was rejected at the 101st with code 100324, after the build had passed.
#
# Keeping the splats at the very bottom leaves four dynamic rules and puts
# everything else in the static list. Nothing above matches these prefixes,
# so moving them down changes no redirect: a splat only ever fires for a path
# no earlier rule claimed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
